{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54448","headline":"七言三首 一 · 林仙人","name":"七言三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万壑松萝拂紫烟，丹台秘邃集神仙。\n乾坤结秀真灵岳，日月飞根照洞天。\n尘世暗移知几代，蟠桃初熟未经年。\n时人莫测幽微事，五色云封种王田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林仙人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54448.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54448","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}